<title>USA: Mansfield, Texas, $2.300 mln won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Mansfield, Texas, $2.300 mln won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds, Inc., said it won $2.300 million of Mansfield, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.41 percent.</p>
</text>
